WEBVTT

00:00:40.833 --> 00:00:44.667
Where do you think you're going, Beta?

00:00:48.875 --> 00:00:50.583
<i>What was that...?</i>

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:52.958
Something wrong, Ikaros?

00:00:52.958 --> 00:00:54.167
No.

00:00:56.208 --> 00:00:57.708
Gammas...

00:00:57.708 --> 00:01:03.583
Yes, we are interceptor
Angeloids, type Gamma, Harpies.

00:01:03.583 --> 00:01:08.292
Let us go together,
to destroy the Uranus Queen.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:16.833
It's all right. We are
here at the request of Master.

00:01:16.833 --> 00:01:21.167
Master has been watching over you,
all this time, from the sky.

00:01:21.167 --> 00:01:23.833
He's quite concerned about you.

00:01:23.833 --> 00:01:25.125
Master is?

00:01:25.125 --> 00:01:27.750
Well, he did make an
unreasonable request of you at first,

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:31.167
telling you to go take
on the Uranus Queen alone.

00:01:31.167 --> 00:01:33.958
Once he thought about what
would happen if you were damaged,

00:01:33.958 --> 00:01:39.042
he was beside himself. He said he
wanted you to come home soon, Beta.

00:01:39.042 --> 00:01:44.583
Say whatever you will,
Master misses you, Beta.

00:01:44.583 --> 00:01:51.875
<i>Master is concerned about me?</i>
<i>Master said he misses me?</i>

00:01:58.292 --> 00:02:03.125
This is what she gets for
being infatuated with a Downer.

00:02:04.375 --> 00:02:08.625
She'll wreck the
Uranus Queen, kill the Downers,

00:02:08.625 --> 00:02:12.917
and return with her head
held high, thinking I will praise her.

00:02:12.917 --> 00:02:16.167
That's when I'll tell
that hunk of damaged goods...

00:02:16.167 --> 00:02:19.750
"You're going to be scrapped."

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:26.375
I just can't wait to see what
sort of face she makes when I do.

00:02:28.958 --> 00:02:32.833
"Queen of the Sky"

00:02:37.833 --> 00:02:39.917
There's no more time.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:47.208
Please, save the angel.
She's being held by the sky.

00:02:56.125 --> 00:02:58.458
That strange dream again?

00:02:59.708 --> 00:03:02.958
Are you waking up, Master?

00:03:02.958 --> 00:03:04.167
Yeah.

00:03:04.667 --> 00:03:06.000
Where's Nymph?

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.417
Well...

00:03:09.333 --> 00:03:12.542
Nymph didn't come back again?!

00:03:12.542 --> 00:03:15.375
No. She did not come home last night.

00:03:15.375 --> 00:03:17.833
Why not, why not? Why wouldn't she?

00:03:17.833 --> 00:03:20.417
How should I know?
Probably just out on a whim.

00:03:20.417 --> 00:03:23.125
You don't have any idea
what might have happened, Tomo?

00:03:23.125 --> 00:03:26.333
You sure you didn't
unintentionally hurt Nymph?

00:03:30.833 --> 00:03:34.542
No, I, uh, I didn't do anything, you could say...

00:03:34.542 --> 00:03:35.792
Oh...?

00:03:35.792 --> 00:03:39.625
The look on your face says you
<i>do </i>have some idea, Sakurai-<i>kun</i>.

00:03:39.625 --> 00:03:42.083
It's nothing at all! Nothing, nothing!

00:03:42.083 --> 00:03:43.583
Come to think of it,

00:03:43.583 --> 00:03:47.667
I saw Nymph flying
toward the forest last night.

00:03:47.667 --> 00:03:48.542
You mean it?

00:03:48.542 --> 00:03:51.917
It looked like she
was fretting over something,

00:03:51.917 --> 00:03:53.917
or maybe it was my imagination.

00:03:57.583 --> 00:04:01.167
Say, are you sure we
shouldn't go look for her, Tomo?

00:04:01.167 --> 00:04:04.042
We're having our Christmas party tonight.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:09.958
She'll probably just
drop in again, like last time.

00:04:09.958 --> 00:04:13.042
For now, we can just get ready
for the party while we wait for her.

00:04:13.042 --> 00:04:17.250
Well then, let's go
look for a tree for our party.

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:21.208
As long as we're getting one,
I'd prefer a big one.

00:04:21.208 --> 00:04:23.917
But if it's too big...

00:04:23.917 --> 00:04:26.292
In that case, I know just the place.

00:04:26.292 --> 00:04:29.083
There are reasonably-sized
trees next to the river near my home.

00:04:29.083 --> 00:04:29.375
Amazing!

00:04:29.375 --> 00:04:31.208
--Ei, do you have something to cut with?
--Taking a real tree and turning it into a decorative tree

00:04:31.208 --> 00:04:31.458
--If you like, I can let you borrow what <i>I've </i>got.
--Taking a real tree and turning it into a decorative tree

00:04:31.458 --> 00:04:35.125
--If you like, I can let you borrow what <i>I've </i>got.
--will make doing the decoration worthwhile, huh, Tomo?

00:04:35.125 --> 00:04:38.875
--Yeah. Well, I'm going to go do some shopping.
--No problem. My firewood-chopping ax should do the job.

00:04:38.875 --> 00:04:40.375
You take it from here.

00:04:40.375 --> 00:04:42.250
Come back soon!

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:44.667
Amazing!

00:04:44.667 --> 00:04:46.292
You're so fast!

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:50.917
Huh...?

00:04:52.417 --> 00:04:53.458
No! No!

00:04:53.458 --> 00:04:57.042
Ikaros, you're whipping
it too much! Stop! Stop!

00:04:57.042 --> 00:04:58.792
Yes.

00:04:58.792 --> 00:05:00.708
Aw, man...

00:05:00.708 --> 00:05:02.458
It's charred black.

00:05:02.458 --> 00:05:04.167
I am sorry.

00:05:04.958 --> 00:05:06.625
Never mind, never mind.

00:05:06.625 --> 00:05:12.333
Still, this is fun, huh?
Just us girls, making a cake together.

00:05:13.542 --> 00:05:16.542
I wish Nymph were here with us, too.

00:05:20.167 --> 00:05:21.458
What is that?

00:05:21.458 --> 00:05:23.375
Oh, this?

00:05:23.375 --> 00:05:27.750
I brought it, thinking we could
use it to decorate for the party.

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:30.000
It's fun just looking at these, right?

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.583
We sure have done a lot of things together.

00:05:37.167 --> 00:05:40.083
This picture is my favorite.

00:05:40.083 --> 00:05:42.542
I never imagined when we first met, Ikaros,

00:05:42.542 --> 00:05:46.292
that we would ever hit it off so well.

00:05:46.292 --> 00:05:48.292
I sure am glad.

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:02.000
I see.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.542
This place is as good as you said it was.

00:06:04.542 --> 00:06:07.667
There will be nowhere for her to hide here,

00:06:07.667 --> 00:06:09.792
and it has plenty of visibility.

00:06:13.958 --> 00:06:16.500
We'll set up like we already discussed.

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:21.750
You'll use your P-Stealth
system to make us invisible.

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:24.167
We'll back you up when the time comes.

00:06:24.167 --> 00:06:25.792
Back me up?

00:06:26.542 --> 00:06:30.583
With the hyperpyro
compression cannon, Prometheus.

00:06:30.583 --> 00:06:33.250
It launches vaporized matter,
heated to 3000 degrees celsius

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:35.750
at 4000 meters per second.

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:37.458
As long as we don't allow her enough time

00:06:37.458 --> 00:06:39.250
to think about raising her Aegis,

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:41.958
the Uranus Queen
is no different than you or me.

00:06:41.958 --> 00:06:43.042
--We'll take her down in an instant.

00:06:43.042 --> 00:06:45.000
--J-Just a minute!
--We'll take her down in an instant.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:48.542
Master's orders weren't to
destroy her, just to bring her back.

00:06:48.542 --> 00:06:51.417
We're just going to persuade
the Alpha to return, right?

00:06:51.417 --> 00:06:53.000
Of course.

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:57.458
But if it comes to it, we have
to be able to protect ourselves.

00:06:57.458 --> 00:06:58.375
--Isn't that right?

00:06:58.375 --> 00:07:03.333
We need your help, so that we don't
have to use these unruly things.

00:07:04.583 --> 00:07:06.083
It'll be fine.

00:07:06.083 --> 00:07:10.208
I'm sure you'll be able to
persuade the Uranus Queen.

00:07:10.208 --> 00:07:11.917
This is just an insurance policy.

00:07:11.917 --> 00:07:14.292
This is all the will of Master.

00:07:14.292 --> 00:07:18.000
Can you imagine how thrilled
Master will be if you succeed?

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:19.667
Am I right?

00:07:19.667 --> 00:07:22.667
<i>Master will be thrilled.</i>

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:26.125
All right.

00:07:27.167 --> 00:07:31.167
But promise me you won't do
anything until I'm done persuading her.

00:07:31.167 --> 00:07:31.875
--Yes.

00:07:31.875 --> 00:07:33.500
--Of course.
--Yes.

00:07:46.917 --> 00:07:49.583
I wonder what your master will think

00:07:49.583 --> 00:07:51.750
once he finds out what you really are,

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:54.375
you weapon of mass destruction!

00:07:56.375 --> 00:07:58.667
What are you doing?

00:08:00.083 --> 00:08:03.958
Nymph, the sky here is wide open.

00:08:05.333 --> 00:08:12.125
Yeah, we Angeloids might
never laugh from the heart.

00:08:12.125 --> 00:08:16.375
If that's true... you'd want to run away.

00:08:17.625 --> 00:08:20.792
Isn't that right... Alpha?

00:08:35.083 --> 00:08:38.042
Where are you going, Ikaros?

00:08:38.042 --> 00:08:42.125
I just, um, need to go buy some things...

00:08:42.125 --> 00:08:46.250
In that case, we can call up
Tomo. He's already out shopping.

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:48.375
Yes, but...

00:08:51.333 --> 00:08:52.292
Listen,

00:08:52.292 --> 00:08:56.958
Ikaros, you promised,
no more lies, remember?

00:08:56.958 --> 00:09:01.667
We're friends, so we can
discuss anything, you know?

00:09:22.958 --> 00:09:24.458
All right.

00:09:24.458 --> 00:09:28.292
The cake will finish baking soon,
so come back quickly, okay?

00:09:54.708 --> 00:09:58.500
Huh? Oh, you came to pick me up?

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:02.000
Ah, perfect timing.
You can carry one of the bags.

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:06.792
I bought a bunch of tree
decorations, noisemakers and stuff.

00:10:07.708 --> 00:10:09.792
--Master...
--Oh, yeah...

00:10:09.792 --> 00:10:11.667
Here, look at this.

00:10:11.667 --> 00:10:15.667
Isn't this funny?
It's a goofy Santa mask.

00:10:17.792 --> 00:10:18.917
Master...

00:10:18.917 --> 00:10:21.500
Ikaros, you try it on.

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:28.292
It looks perfect on you!

00:10:31.375 --> 00:10:33.042
I am leaving.

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:35.417
Huh?

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:39.625
I came to say that I am leaving.

00:10:40.708 --> 00:10:46.208
It has not been very long, but thank
you for all that you have done.

00:10:48.625 --> 00:10:52.583
I will not forget you, Master.

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:59.417
I really... really... sincerely...

00:10:59.417 --> 00:11:02.125
W-What?

00:11:02.125 --> 00:11:06.083
This is a bad joke, right? Right, Ikaros?

00:11:09.958 --> 00:11:12.250
...loved you...

00:11:16.917 --> 00:11:19.125
...my master.

00:11:21.917 --> 00:11:23.625
Farewell.

00:12:13.083 --> 00:12:15.167
<i>No doubt about it.</i>

00:12:15.167 --> 00:12:17.625
<i>This is an attack from the sky.</i>

00:12:19.042 --> 00:12:21.625
<i>Commence blast trace data scan.</i>

00:12:21.625 --> 00:12:26.667
<i>Analysis indicates interceptor</i>
<i>Angeloid, type Gamma, Harpy.</i>

00:12:27.833 --> 00:12:29.833
<i>I am picking up Nymph.</i>

00:12:33.583 --> 00:12:35.917
<i>I am probably the target.</i>

00:12:35.917 --> 00:12:41.000
<i>I am about to fight as the</i>
<i>weapon that Master hates so much.</i>

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:43.583
<i>I cannot go back to Master...</i>

00:12:44.708 --> 00:12:46.167
<i>...ever again.</i>

00:12:48.333 --> 00:12:50.417
<i>"Farewell" my foot!</i>

00:12:50.417 --> 00:12:52.917
Wow, it's big!

00:12:52.917 --> 00:12:55.792
We couldn't seem to find a good tree.

00:12:55.792 --> 00:12:59.250
Mikako insisted that we get a large one.

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:00.167
Is Ikaros here?!

00:13:00.167 --> 00:13:01.583
Tomo?

00:13:04.708 --> 00:13:05.458
--Damn.

00:13:05.458 --> 00:13:07.292
--H-Hold on, Tomo!
--Damn.

00:13:12.833 --> 00:13:15.542
<i>Ikaros and Nymph dropped in uninvited,</i>

00:13:15.542 --> 00:13:17.750
<i>and both disappeared on their own.</i>

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:21.125
<i>Do they expect me to</i>
<i>not be worried about them?</i>

00:13:21.125 --> 00:13:25.000
<i>This is why I didn't want</i>
<i>to live together with Angeloids.</i>

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:26.958
<i>With them gone, </i>

00:13:26.958 --> 00:13:31.417
<i>days of peace and quiet should</i>
<i>be in store for me again, and yet...</i>

00:13:38.333 --> 00:13:39.417
Nymph...

00:13:39.417 --> 00:13:44.750
Impressive. As soon as I turned
off my stealth mode, you found me.

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:46.500
I'm sorry, Alpha.

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:50.208
There's something I just
had to speak to you alone about.

00:13:51.375 --> 00:13:54.375
I haven't said anything, but the truth is,

00:13:54.375 --> 00:13:56.667
I was sent to bring you back up to the sky.

00:13:56.667 --> 00:13:58.083
I know.

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:03.500
Oh.

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:05.083
You knew.

00:14:24.042 --> 00:14:26.958
<i>Why am I looking for them?</i>

00:14:30.375 --> 00:14:31.917
Sorry to keep you waiting,

00:14:31.917 --> 00:14:32.958
Tomoki.

00:14:32.958 --> 00:14:35.125
Sugata...

00:14:35.125 --> 00:14:38.417
You're looking for Ikaros and Nymph, right?

00:14:39.792 --> 00:14:42.583
Judging from eyewitness reports in the area,

00:14:42.583 --> 00:14:45.500
they haven't gone too far away.

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:46.958
Taking into account direction and wind speed,

00:14:46.958 --> 00:14:49.458
coupled with their physical abilities,

00:14:49.458 --> 00:14:52.000
I would suggest that we search in this area.

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:53.042
Sugata...

00:14:53.042 --> 00:14:55.250
I know exactly what you're thinking.

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:58.583
Hop on, Tomoki.

00:14:58.583 --> 00:15:00.708
No fair, Ei,

00:15:01.625 --> 00:15:04.167
trying to be the only one looking brave.

00:15:15.167 --> 00:15:17.375
Why...?

00:15:17.375 --> 00:15:20.000
This isn't what we agreed to, is it?!

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:23.375
You told me you would let
me persuade her, didn't you?!

00:15:23.375 --> 00:15:25.417
Why did you suddenly attack?!

00:15:25.417 --> 00:15:28.833
You fool, we were lying.

00:15:28.833 --> 00:15:32.000
But then, thanks to this fool,
we scored an easy victory, didn't we?

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:34.958
That's true. Thank you, Nymph.

00:15:34.958 --> 00:15:37.583
We have our own particular reasons.

00:15:37.583 --> 00:15:40.250
You lied...? Then, Master didn't...

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:42.250
All we're here for is to recover

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:46.875
the Uranus System core she
possesses-- her variable wings.

00:15:46.875 --> 00:15:49.583
That's all that Master
said to bring back with us.

00:15:49.583 --> 00:15:52.000
Which means that your role is complete.

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:53.500
Oh, no! But you just said--

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:56.375
Forget it! Away with you, you filthy brat!

00:16:00.042 --> 00:16:02.500
<i>D-Don't...</i>

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:05.250
Hmph, this is surprisingly
anticlimactic, huh?

00:16:05.250 --> 00:16:08.292
Bye-bye, Uranus Queen.

00:16:08.292 --> 00:16:12.292
<i>Don't... Tomoki will be sad...!</i>

00:16:17.042 --> 00:16:18.958
Paradise Song!!

00:16:21.625 --> 00:16:22.500
--Mikako...

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:24.750
--Chairman, you too?
--Mikako...

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:27.542
There's no time, right? So...

00:16:37.917 --> 00:16:39.708
Tomo...

00:16:39.708 --> 00:16:41.208
You wait here.

00:16:41.208 --> 00:16:42.875
No! I'm coming, too!

00:16:42.875 --> 00:16:44.042
You can't! This could get--

00:16:44.042 --> 00:16:48.417
Ikaros and Nymph
are dear friends to me, too!

00:16:48.417 --> 00:16:53.708
If you don't let me come,
I'll chop you! I'll chop you to death!

00:16:55.625 --> 00:16:57.042
All right.

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:03.958
I blew you to pieces! Serves you right!

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:07.750
<i>Nymph...</i>

00:17:18.083 --> 00:17:19.917
No... No!

00:17:23.375 --> 00:17:25.875
What's with the banner?

00:17:25.875 --> 00:17:28.292
It was Mitsuki's idea.

00:17:28.292 --> 00:17:32.083
"Happy birthday Ikaros and Nymph."

00:17:32.083 --> 00:17:35.000
Do those two even have birthdays?

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:38.958
Mm-mm. I asked them earlier,
but they said they didn't, so,

00:17:38.958 --> 00:17:43.417
I talked it over with Sugata
and the chairman, and had it made.

00:17:43.417 --> 00:17:46.750
They're angels, so we figured,
it would have to be on Christmas.

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:48.292
Why are you doing this?

00:17:48.292 --> 00:17:52.125
Well, I mean, Ikaros is
still so doll-like, you might say,

00:17:52.125 --> 00:17:54.417
and never smiles at all.

00:17:54.417 --> 00:17:57.833
And Nymph sometimes
lets on that she's so lonesome.

00:17:57.833 --> 00:18:01.083
So, we decided to
take today's Christmas party,

00:18:01.083 --> 00:18:04.875
and make it a birthday for
Ikaros and Nymph, as well.

00:18:04.875 --> 00:18:07.625
Here, look at this, Tomo. Ta-da!

00:18:07.625 --> 00:18:10.625
A memory album, "Sohara's collection"!

00:18:10.625 --> 00:18:15.042
This takes me back.
This one is from when we went camping.

00:18:15.042 --> 00:18:17.708
And this is from our trip to the beach.

00:18:17.708 --> 00:18:20.333
There are pictures from the
culture festival, too. Here, look.

00:18:20.333 --> 00:18:24.792
These are nice photos.
I'm sure Ikaros and Nymph

00:18:24.792 --> 00:18:27.500
will automatically
smile when they see these.

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:30.542
I didn't know what I could do for them,

00:18:30.542 --> 00:18:33.750
so I figured I could at least start with this.

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:36.542
What's the matter, Tomoki? You look down.

00:18:36.542 --> 00:18:41.208
You're wishing you could
do more for them too, aren't you?

00:18:41.208 --> 00:18:45.250
To get Ikaros and Nymph to
laugh, from the heart?

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:50.250
I can't do anything.
All I ever do is bring them to tears.

00:18:50.250 --> 00:18:52.417
I can't do anything to make them laugh.

00:18:52.417 --> 00:18:55.167
You should follow Mitsuki's example.

00:18:55.167 --> 00:18:59.500
Even if you can't do anything,
there's still <i>something </i>you can do.

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:02.667
There has to be something
that only you can do.

00:19:02.667 --> 00:19:05.125
Assuming you don't
want to kick yourself later.

00:19:12.625 --> 00:19:16.333
What kind of birthday
present could I give them

00:19:16.333 --> 00:19:18.625
that would make them happy?

00:19:20.708 --> 00:19:24.542
Impossible! She took a
Prometheus blast head-on!

00:19:25.917 --> 00:19:30.417
I don't know. Why don't you
try asking them directly?

00:19:30.417 --> 00:19:34.125
I will. But before I do...

00:19:34.125 --> 00:19:36.625
We're taking those two with us!

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:39.750
How awful.

00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:46.000
Nymph's wings... They were
so pretty, and they ripped them out!

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:49.458
Variable wing system safety released.

00:19:49.458 --> 00:19:52.833
No, Alpha! If Tomoki
and the others find out...!

00:19:54.042 --> 00:19:56.542
Mode Uranus Queen on.

00:19:56.542 --> 00:19:57.958
Alpha!

00:20:06.875 --> 00:20:08.292
Master...

00:20:08.292 --> 00:20:10.583
...I am terribly sorry,

00:20:10.583 --> 00:20:13.583
but I have been lying to you up to now.

00:20:13.583 --> 00:20:18.375
I am a strategic Angeloid,
type Alpha, Ikaros,

00:20:18.375 --> 00:20:21.083
a weapon, which you despise, Master.

00:20:26.750 --> 00:20:28.583
Yeah, I knew.

00:20:30.125 --> 00:20:32.125
Say, Ikaros,

00:20:32.125 --> 00:20:37.667
I said that I didn't like weapons
because I felt sorry for you.

00:20:37.667 --> 00:20:39.167
Yes...

00:20:39.167 --> 00:20:42.917
Doting on watermelons,
and raising chicks like you did,

00:20:42.917 --> 00:20:47.083
you were quite kind-hearted,
so I thought that it was too much

00:20:47.083 --> 00:20:51.667
for someone like that
to be a born killing machine.

00:20:52.875 --> 00:20:54.292
Yes...

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:59.667
Even so, Ikaros,
this is what I think now--

00:20:59.667 --> 00:21:05.833
I'm sure glad you're a weapon.
As a result, you can save our friend.

00:21:05.833 --> 00:21:08.125
Yes, Master.

00:21:08.125 --> 00:21:11.792
Please, save Nymph, Ikaros!

00:21:11.792 --> 00:21:13.667
Type Alpha, Ikaros...

00:21:13.667 --> 00:21:15.708
Go!!

00:21:17.875 --> 00:21:19.125
...commencing attack!

00:21:19.125 --> 00:21:20.167
--Damn, here she comes!

00:21:20.167 --> 00:21:21.583
--Scatter!
--Damn, here she comes!

00:21:25.042 --> 00:21:27.000
This is our chance to cut Nymph's chain.

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:28.333
Are you all right, Nymph?

00:21:28.333 --> 00:21:29.708
How awful! Your back!

00:21:29.708 --> 00:21:32.708
You must have a
pretty lousy person for a Master.

00:21:33.583 --> 00:21:35.583
No! If you do that...!

00:21:45.417 --> 00:21:47.375
Why, you...!

00:21:47.375 --> 00:21:49.000
Die!

00:22:00.333 --> 00:22:01.958
Take this!

00:22:05.542 --> 00:22:06.375
Aegis!

00:22:06.375 --> 00:22:08.292
No matter! Keep firing!

00:22:12.667 --> 00:22:14.083
Connect.

00:22:26.583 --> 00:22:28.042
Is that...?

00:22:28.042 --> 00:22:29.958
The Uranus System!

00:22:34.750 --> 00:22:36.375
Cerceis.

00:22:48.208 --> 00:22:50.958
--You can't! Besides, this collar is a bomb!
--Sugata, how can we cut through this chain?

00:22:50.958 --> 00:22:51.750
--A chain is strong against being pulled,

00:22:51.750 --> 00:22:53.875
--Once it reaches its time limit, the detonation code will be sent!
--A chain is strong against being pulled,

00:22:53.875 --> 00:22:55.042
--Once it reaches its time limit, the detonation code will be sent!
--but weak against being wrenched.

00:22:55.042 --> 00:22:55.875
--If you upset the chain improperly,

00:22:55.875 --> 00:22:57.250
--If we twist it, and then hit it with an ax, it should give.
--If you upset the chain improperly,

00:22:57.250 --> 00:22:59.000
--If we twist it, and then hit it with an ax, it should give.
--you might set it off!

00:22:59.000 --> 00:22:59.917
Let's do that!

00:22:59.917 --> 00:23:02.458
Listen to what I'm saying!

00:23:02.458 --> 00:23:06.667
You, and everything else
around here, could all be blown up!

00:23:07.917 --> 00:23:09.667
So what if we are?

00:23:10.250 --> 00:23:13.000
We're your friends, Nymph.

00:23:13.000 --> 00:23:15.708
When friends are in trouble,
they help each other.

00:23:15.708 --> 00:23:18.167
We're just doing what's normal.

00:23:20.458 --> 00:23:24.708
<i>What do I do... Alpha?</i>

00:23:24.708 --> 00:23:26.708
<i>I don't know.</i>

00:23:29.292 --> 00:23:33.250
<i>We Angeloids have never</i>
<i>considered ourselves to be happy,</i>

00:23:33.250 --> 00:23:35.583
<i>from the time we were born.</i>

00:23:36.833 --> 00:23:41.542
<i>We exist for the sake</i>
<i>of our master's happiness.</i>

00:23:45.042 --> 00:23:50.042
<i>But right now,</i>
<i>I'm not sure what I'm feeling.</i>

00:24:00.250 --> 00:24:05.375
<i>More than likely,</i>
<i>what I'm feeling now is happiness.</i>

00:24:09.792 --> 00:24:14.000
<i>I'm sure I could laugh right now.</i>

00:24:14.000 --> 00:24:17.458
<i>Right? Don't you think so,</i>

00:24:17.458 --> 00:24:18.875
<i>Alpha?</i>

00:24:29.583 --> 00:24:35.542
<i>When I whispered to the sky</i>

00:24:35.542 --> 00:24:39.958
<i>I can laugh... from the heart.</i>

00:24:39.958 --> 00:24:48.792
<i>You smiled beside me and answered</i>

00:24:50.542 --> 00:24:53.875
Retreat of hostile forces confirmed.

00:24:53.875 --> 00:24:55.708
Returning to normal mode.

00:25:13.333 --> 00:25:15.958
Hey! Ikaros!

00:25:15.958 --> 00:25:16.792
--How about this?!

00:25:16.792 --> 00:25:18.000
--Ta-da!
--How about this?!

00:25:19.208 --> 00:25:20.625
Good...

00:25:24.708 --> 00:25:26.042
Wow!

00:25:26.042 --> 00:25:27.875
A white Christmas!

00:25:32.833 --> 00:25:34.292
Pretty...

00:25:35.292 --> 00:25:36.625
She's right.

00:25:37.875 --> 00:25:41.292
The sky on the earth is wide open.

00:25:55.083 --> 00:26:00.375
<i>I say a prayer, unable to contain</i>
<i>(I say another prayer, so as not to lose)</i>

00:26:00.375 --> 00:26:08.417
<i>the aching that fills my heart</i>
<i>(the aching in my heart for you)</i>

00:26:08.417 --> 00:26:18.917
<i>I want to move forward,</i>
<i>if only a step at a time</i>

00:26:18.917 --> 00:26:28.333
<i>and not interrupt our</i>
<i>seasons spent together</i>

00:26:28.333 --> 00:26:38.750
<i>Standing side by side</i>
<i>with you, I can't wait</i>

00:26:38.750 --> 00:26:52.333
<i>for even the future</i>
<i>I once feared to arrive</i>

00:27:11.042 --> 00:27:21.333
<i>Should I let what I'm feeling reach you?</i>

00:27:21.333 --> 00:27:30.958
<i>I'm glad just to be at your side</i>

00:27:31.917 --> 00:27:42.417
<i>Under this ever-changing sky,</i>
<i>I want to change as well,</i>

00:27:42.417 --> 00:27:53.083
<i>if it means I can tenderly</i>
<i>smile like you someday</i>

00:28:12.792 --> 00:28:15.083
Merry Christmas

00:28:15.083 --> 00:28:16.000
and

00:28:16.000 --> 00:28:17.917
Happy Birthday,

00:28:17.917 --> 00:28:20.208
Ikaros and Nymph!

00:28:27.000 --> 00:28:29.708
Listen, Ikaros and Nymph,

00:28:29.708 --> 00:28:33.167
you can keep on staying here, from now on.

00:28:33.167 --> 00:28:37.875
You know, think of it as my present to you.

00:28:37.875 --> 00:28:39.708
These are a little something extra.

00:28:41.917 --> 00:28:46.958
Tomo! You're always doing
this, same as with me...!

00:28:52.250 --> 00:28:55.375
<i>You finally laughed, Alpha.</i>

00:28:55.375 --> 00:28:58.750
Y-You just laughed a little bit, didn't you?!

00:28:58.750 --> 00:28:59.792
One more time!

00:28:59.792 --> 00:29:01.792
Try doing it one more time!

00:29:04.875 --> 00:29:06.583
Grin.

00:29:06.583 --> 00:29:29.984
No, you dummy!!
